    "done_when": "Re-compacting minute rows into an hour row takes the hour's opening from the first minute row's opening, not its closing (one job counting 0, 1000, 1000, 2000 in one hour gives the same open 0, close 2000 whether compacted raw to hour or raw to minute to hour); TelemetryIndex.partitioned_total reads a compacted row's opening, so a window whose samples come only from compacted files totals each run as closing minus opening; tests/test_telemetry_compaction_runs.py asserts, through TelemetryIndex.partitioned_total over indexes built from each tier's file alone, that the raw, minute and hour files give the same total for a window holding a serve restart (520,000) and for a null-rich stretch; gate: uv run --no-sync pytest -p no:cacheprovider tests/test_telemetry_store.py tests/test_telemetry_index.py tests/test_agent_telemetry_watch.py tests/test_telemetry_compaction_runs.py passes, pytest tests/test_agent_serve_registry.py -k agent_package_modules_parse_with_serving_python passes, uv run --no-sync ruff check imas_ambix tests exits 0; the gate log's first line names the commit it ran at and each command's exit status is recorded as EXIT=0 or the non-zero status; no receipts file and no file under /work/projects/imas_gpu is written",
